The original is only the version received from the author (Dmitriy336-pixel, official GitHub repository). The author did not create, check or take responsibility for versions from other sources, or for any code that other people added to the program, including malicious code (viruses, spyware and other dangerous programs). If you received the program from anyone other than the author, you use it at your own risk. Download the program only from the official source.

